  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International protection for Guatemalan human rights defenders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to protect the working space of individuals and organizations in Guatemala who face repression due to their activities in defence of human rights, through an international accompaniment programme that is based on the following strategies: (1) physical accompaniment; (2) advocacy with the international community in Guatemala and abroad; (3) information for Guatemala government authorities; (4) improvement of the protection and security tools and skills of Guatemalan civil society organisations</narrative>
  </description>
